	(text "GPIO INDICATOR LEDS: 470 ohm + white LED from each listed GPIO net to ground (about 1 mA).\nGPIO40-47 (ADC pins): the LED is on by default; the board has a narrow trace neck to cut with a knife to disconnect it.\nEvery pin here is also on a connector or header, so the LED lights for any accessory."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
